    {"id":"e20","type":"text","x":45,"y":1396,"width":620,"height":155,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#78350f","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":null,"seed":200,"version":1,"versionNonce":2000,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1749000000000,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"Kondisi penyimpanan:\n  Suhu       : 4 derajat C (kulkas, bukan freezer!)\n  Kondisi    : Kering, tutup dengan parafilm\n  Masa pakai : 2-4 minggu\n\n  JANGAN bekukan  → GOx RUSAK di freezer\n  JANGAN simpan basah → mudah terkontaminasi\n\n→ Cartridge siap digunakan untuk pengukuran glukosa","fontSize":13,"fontFamily":1,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","baseline":12,"containerId":null,"originalText":"Kondisi penyimpanan:\n  Suhu       : 4 derajat C (kulkas, bukan freezer!)\n  Kondisi    : Kering, tutup dengan parafilm\n  Masa pakai : 2-4 minggu\n\n  JANGAN bekukan  → GOx RUSAK di freezer\n  JANGAN simpan basah → mudah terkontaminasi\n\n→ Cartridge siap digunakan untuk pengukuran glukosa","lineHeight":1.4},
